        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "TD100 is an electric/hydraulic limited-access drill rig designed to safely install cased micropiles. The rig’s model number indicates the horsepower of the electric motor."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Its rubber tracks can contract to 1,219 mm to enter difficult drilling positions. The 100 hp motor allows it to drive all TEI-made rotary heads."
        },
        {
          "type": "datasheet",
          "title": "Technical data",
          "note": "TEI’s technical specifications assume a 40% hydraulic power loss.",
          "tagline": "Drill rig for confined spaces",
          "intro": [
            "TD100 is an electric/hydraulic drill rig for confined spaces, designed to safely install cased micropiles and large hollow-bar micropiles. The rubber tracks can be drawn in to 48 inches (1,219 mm) so that the rig can be driven into hard-to-reach drilling positions.",
            "The 100 hp motor allows the TD100 to drive all drifters and rotary heads from TEI. The possibilities with the TD100 are many."
          ],
